for, to the end:
  open for
  1
  2
  3
  dispose for
  after the loop
for, with a return:
  open returning
  dispose returning
  returned 2
for, with an exception:
  open throwing
  dispose throwing
  caught stop at 1
  after the try
if:
  open if
  in the then arm
  dispose if
  after the if
elif:
  open first
  open second
  second arm
  dispose second
  dispose first
  after the if
if let:
  open if let
  in the arm, count 3
  dispose if let
  after the if
case:
  open case
  three
  dispose case
  after the case
a loop as a value:
  open value
  dispose value
  found 2
yield inside a for:
  open generator
  first 1
  dispose generator
  open generator
  dispose generator
  all 3
case guard:
  open guard
  matched
  dispose guard
  after the case
an argument still belongs to the block:
  open argument
  count 3
  after the statement
  dispose argument
